### Test JWT Authentication Flow

# Step 1: Login to get JWT tokens
POST http://localhost:5122/api/Account/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ascendid.local",
  "password": "AdminPassword123!"
}

### Step 2: Test protected endpoint with JWT token
# Copy the accessToken from the login response and replace {token} below
GET http://localhost:5122/api/Account/profile
Authorization: Bearer {token}

### Step 3: Test token refresh
# Copy the refreshToken from the login response and replace {refresh_token} below
POST http://localhost:5122/api/Account/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{refresh_token}"
}

### Step 4: Test without authorization (should fail)
GET http://localhost:5122/api/Account/profile